I tend to play my early wizards as offensive spellcasters recently, with
some success. Spell friendly armor isn't too hard to find. I still use
Elbereth, pets and daggers, but I do also rely on spells. So maybe the 
above concern is specific to this playing style.

>   Very rarely is it worth casting a spell in combat, especially 
